    "DimensionDoor": "heroPointer/win/x/y -> corresponding targetHero/window/newX/newY; keep targetCell and HoMM1 bytecode operations, i16 coordinates, checks and localization.",
    "AdvPanel": "Follow donor scope: adventurePanel stays in the function scope; saved hero state and message live in the inner block. Initialize corresponding i32 heroWasMobilized at the original assignment point. Window is -16, message -32 and saved state -36 in the EH frame; no new local or operation."
